          "language": "en"
        },
        {
          "text": "\n",
          "start_time": 130.48799999999997,
          "end_time": 130.48799999999997,
          "language": "en"
        },
        {
          "text": "Frequent cycles of \"start–interrupt–self-blame\";",
          "start_time": 76.512,
          "end_time": 80.712,
          "language": "en"
        },
        {
          "text": "\n",
          "start_time": 130.48799999999997,
          "end_time": 130.48799999999997,
          "language": "en"
        },
        {
          "text": "Frequent cycles of “start–interrupt–self-blame”;",
          "start_time": 76.512,
          "end_time": 80.712,
          "language": "source"
        },
        {
          "text": "\n",
          "start_time": 130.48799999999997,
          "end_time": 130.48799999999997,
          "language": "en"
        },
        {
          "text": "Often caught in the \"start—interrupt—self-blame\" cycle;",
          "start_time": 76.512,
          "end_time": 80.712,
          "language": "source"
        },
        {
          "text": "\n",
          "start_time": 130.48799999999997,
          "end_time": 130.48799999999997,
          "language": "en"
        },
        {
          "text": "[经常陷入“开始—中断—自责”的循环；",
          "start_time": 76.512,
          "end_time": 80.712,
          "language": "source"
        },
        {
          "text": "]",
          "start_time": 80.712,
          "end_time": 80.976,
          "language": "en"
        },
        {
          "text": "\n",
          "start_time": 130.48799999999997,
          "end_time": 130.48799999999997,
          "language": "en"
        },
        {
          "text": "And the inability to build positive long-term momentum.",
          "start_time": 80.976,
          "end_time": 84.93599999999999,
          "language": "en"
        },
        {
          "text": "\n",
          "start_time": 130.48799999999997,
          "end_time": 130.48799999999997,
          "language": "en"
        },
        {
          "text": "And the inability to build positive long-term momentum.",
          "start_time": 80.976,
          "end_time": 84.93599999999999,
          "language": "source"
        },
        {
          "text": "\n",
          "start_time": 130.48799999999997,
          "end_time": 130.48799999999997,
          "language": "en"
        },
        {
          "text": "It's difficult to establish a positive feedback loop for sustained focus.",
          "start_time": 80.976,
          "end_time": 84.93599999999999,
          "language": "source"
        },
        {
          "text": "\n",
          "start_time": 130.48799999999997,
          "end_time": 130.48799999999997,
          "language": "en"
        },
        {
          "text": "[难以形成长期专注的正反馈。",
          "start_time": 80.976,
          "end_time": 84.93599999999999,
          "language": "source"
        },
        {
          "text": "]",
          "start_time": 84.93599999999999,
          "end_time": 85.19999999999999,
          "language": "en"
        },
        {
          "text": "\n",
          "start_time": 130.48799999999997,
          "end_time": 130.48799999999997,
          "language": "en"
        },
        {
          "text": "Focus isn’t about forcing yourself—it’s maintained through clear values and smart context design.",
          "start_time": 85.19999999999999,
          "end_time": 91.89599999999999,
          "language": "en"
        },
        {
          "text": "\n",
          "start_time": 130.48799999999997,
          "end_time": 130.48799999999997,
          "language": "en"
        },
        {
          "text": "Focus isn’t about forcing yourself—it’s maintained through value clarity and smart context design.",
          "start_time": 85.19999999999999,
          "end_time": 91.89599999999999,
          "language": "source"
        },
        {
          "text": "\n",
          "start_time": 130.48799999999997,
          "end_time": 130.48799999999997,
          "language": "en"
        },
        {
          "text": "Focus isn’t achieved by forcing willpower—it’s sustained instead through \"value prioritization + environment design.\"",
          "start_time": 85.19999999999999,
          "end_time": 91.89599999999999,
          "language": "source"
        },
        {
          "text": "\n",
          "start_time": 130.48799999999997,
          "end_time": 130.48799999999997,
          "language": "en"
        },
        {
          "text": "[专注不是靠强迫意志力，而是依靠“价值排序 + 情境设计”来维持。",
          "start_time": 85.19999999999999,
          "end_time": 91.89599999999999,
          "language": "source"
        },
        {
          "text": "]",
          "start_time": 91.89599999999999,
          "end_time": 92.15999999999998,
          "language": "en"
        },
        {
          "text": "\n",
          "start_time": 130.48799999999997,
          "end_time": 130.48799999999997,
          "language": "en"
        },
        {
          "text": "We often think focus requires endurance, but that’s a misunderstanding.",
          "start_time": 92.15999999999998,
          "end_time": 96.76799999999999,
          "language": "en"
        },
        {
          "text": "\n",
          "start_time": 130.48799999999997,
          "end_time": 130.48799999999997,
          "language": "en"
        },
        {
          "text": "We often think focus requires endurance, but that’s a misunderstanding.",
          "start_time": 92.15999999999998,
          "end_time": 96.76799999999999,
          "language": "source"
        },
        {
          "text": "\n",
          "start_time": 130.48799999999997,
          "end_time": 130.48799999999997,
          "language": "en"
        },
        {
          "text": "We often think focus comes from sheer willpower, but that’s actually not the case.",
          "start_time": 92.15999999999998,
          "end_time": 96.76799999999999,
          "language": "source"
        },
        {
          "text": "\n",
          "start_time": 130.48799999999997,
          "end_time": 130.48799999999997,
          "language": "en"
        },
        {
          "text": "[我们常以为专注靠强忍，其实并非如此。",
          "start_time": 92.15999999999998,
          "end_time": 96.76799999999999,
          "language": "source"
        },
        {
          "text": "]",
          "start_time": 96.76799999999999,
          "end_time": 97.03199999999998,
          "language": "en"
        },
        {
          "text": "\n",
          "start_time": 130.48799999999997,
          "end_time": 130.48799999999997,
          "language": "en"
        },
        {
          "text": "Real focus comes from:",
          "start_time": 97.03199999999998,
          "end_time": 98.63999999999999,
          "language": "en"
        },
        {
          "text": "\n",
          "start_time": 130.48799999999997,
          "end_time": 130.48799999999997,
          "language": "en"
        },
        {
          "text": "Real focus comes from:",
          "start_time": 97.03199999999998,
          "end_time": 98.63999999999999,
          "language": "source"
        },
        {
          "text": "\n",
          "start_time": 130.48799999999997,
          "end_time": 130.48799999999997,
          "language": "en"
        },
        {
          "text": "True focus stems from:",
          "start_time": 97.03199999999998,
          "end_time": 98.63999999999999,
          "language": "source"
        },
        {
          "text": "\n",
          "start_time": 130.48799999999997,
          "end_time": 130.48799999999997,
          "language": "en"
        },
        {
          "text": "[真正的专注源于：",
          "start_time": 97.03199999999998,
          "end_time": 98.63999999999999,
          "language": "source"
        },
        {
          "text": "]",
          "start_time": 98.63999999999999,
