          "language": "en"
        },
        {
          "text": "\n",
          "start_time": 130.48799999999997,
          "end_time": 130.48799999999997,
          "language": "en"
        },
        {
          "text": "1. A value-driven long-term vision (Why am I doing this?)",
          "start_time": 98.90399999999998,
          "end_time": 103.58399999999997,
          "language": "en"
        },
        {
          "text": "\n",
          "start_time": 130.48799999999997,
          "end_time": 130.48799999999997,
          "language": "en"
        },
        {
          "text": "1. A value-driven long-term vision (Why am I doing this?)",
          "start_time": 98.90399999999998,
          "end_time": 103.58399999999997,
          "language": "source"
        },
        {
          "text": "\n",
          "start_time": 130.48799999999997,
          "end_time": 130.48799999999997,
          "language": "en"
        },
        {
          "text": "→ This provides you with inner strength when confronted with temptation.",
          "start_time": 103.58399999999997,
          "end_time": 107.83199999999998,
          "language": "en"
        },
        {
          "text": "\n",
          "start_time": 130.48799999999997,
          "end_time": 130.48799999999997,
          "language": "en"
        },
        {
          "text": "→ This gives you internal support when faced with temptation.",
          "start_time": 103.58399999999997,
          "end_time": 107.83199999999998,
          "language": "source"
        },
        {
          "text": "\n",
          "start_time": 130.48799999999997,
          "end_time": 130.48799999999997,
          "language": "en"
        },
        {
          "text": "1. A values-driven long-term vision (Why I’m doing this) → This provides inner strength when temptation strikes.",
          "start_time": 103.58399999999997,
          "end_time": 107.83199999999998,
          "language": "source"
        },
        {
          "text": "\n",
          "start_time": 130.48799999999997,
          "end_time": 130.48799999999997,
          "language": "en"
        },
        {
          "text": "[1. 价值观驱动的长期愿景（我为什么要做这件事）→ 这能在诱惑来临时提供内在支撑。",
          "start_time": 103.58399999999997,
          "end_time": 107.83199999999998,
          "language": "source"
        },
        {
          "text": "]",
          "start_time": 107.83199999999998,
