          "language": "en"
        },
        {
          "text": "\n",
          "start_time": 130.48799999999997,
          "end_time": 130.48799999999997,
          "language": "en"
        },
        {
          "text": "2. Breaking down short-term goals (How do I move forward?)",
          "start_time": 108.09599999999998,
          "end_time": 112.24799999999998,
          "language": "en"
        },
        {
          "text": "\n",
          "start_time": 130.48799999999997,
          "end_time": 130.48799999999997,
          "language": "en"
        },
        {
          "text": "2. Breaking down short-term goals (How do I move forward?)",
          "start_time": 108.09599999999998,
          "end_time": 112.24799999999998,
          "language": "source"
        },
        {
          "text": "\n",
          "start_time": 130.48799999999997,
          "end_time": 130.48799999999997,
          "language": "en"
        },
        {
          "text": "→ This helps you enter \"action mode\" instead of getting stuck in delay.",
          "start_time": 112.24799999999998,
          "end_time": 116.32799999999997,
          "language": "en"
        },
        {
          "text": "\n",
          "start_time": 130.48799999999997,
          "end_time": 130.48799999999997,
          "language": "en"
        },
        {
          "text": "→ This helps you enter “action mode” instead of getting stuck in delay.",
          "start_time": 112.24799999999998,
          "end_time": 116.32799999999997,
          "language": "source"
        },
        {
          "text": "\n",
          "start_time": 130.48799999999997,
          "end_time": 130.48799999999997,
          "language": "en"
        },
        {
          "text": "2. Breaking down short-term goals (How do I move forward?) → This helps you get into \"action mode\" and prevents you from getting stuck in procrastination.",
          "start_time": 112.24799999999998,
          "end_time": 116.32799999999997,
          "language": "source"
        },
        {
          "text": "\n",
          "start_time": 130.48799999999997,
          "end_time": 130.48799999999997,
          "language": "en"
        },
        {
          "text": "[2. 对短期目标的拆解（我该怎么推进）→ 这能让你进入“行动状态”，避免陷入拖延。",
          "start_time": 112.24799999999998,
          "end_time": 116.32799999999997,
          "language": "source"
        },
        {
          "text": "]",
          "start_time": 116.32799999999997,
          "end_time": 116.59199999999997,
          "language": "en"
        },
        {
          "text": "\n",
          "start_time": 130.48799999999997,
          "end_time": 130.48799999999997,
          "language": "en"
        },
        {
          "text": "3. Designing Your Environment and Tools (How Do I Avoid Distractions?)",
          "start_time": 116.59199999999997,
          "end_time": 121.75199999999997,
          "language": "en"
        },
        {
          "text": "\n",
          "start_time": 130.48799999999997,
          "end_time": 130.48799999999997,
          "language": "en"
        },
        {
          "text": "3. Designing your environment and tools (How do I avoid distractions?)",
          "start_time": 116.59199999999997,
          "end_time": 121.75199999999997,
          "language": "source"
        },
        {
          "text": "\n",
          "start_time": 130.48799999999997,
          "end_time": 130.48799999999997,
          "language": "en"
        },
        {
          "text": "→ Focus isn’t about resisting temptation, but about eliminating it.",
          "start_time": 121.75199999999997,
          "end_time": 126.40799999999997,
          "language": "en"
        },
        {
          "text": "\n",
          "start_time": 130.48799999999997,
          "end_time": 130.48799999999997,
          "language": "en"
        },
        {
          "text": "→ Focus isn’t about resisting temptation, but removing it.",
          "start_time": 121.75199999999997,
          "end_time": 126.40799999999997,
          "language": "source"
        },
        {
          "text": "\n",
          "start_time": 130.48799999999997,
          "end_time": 130.48799999999997,
          "language": "en"
        },
        {
          "text": "3. Designing Environment and Tools (How to Avoid Distractions) → Focus isn’t about resisting temptation—it’s about eliminating it altogether.",
          "start_time": 121.75199999999997,
          "end_time": 126.40799999999997,
          "language": "source"
        },
        {
          "text": "\n",
          "start_time": 130.48799999999997,
          "end_time": 130.48799999999997,
          "language": "en"
        },
        {
          "text": "[3. 环境和工具的设计（如何避免干扰）→ 专注不是忍住诱惑，而是排除诱惑。",
          "start_time": 121.75199999999997,
          "end_time": 126.40799999999997,
          "language": "source"
        },
        {
          "text": "]",
          "start_time": 126.40799999999997,
          "end_time": 126.67199999999997,
          "language": "en"
        },
        {
          "text": "\n",
          "start_time": 130.48799999999997,
          "end_time": 130.48799999999997,
          "language": "en"
        },
        {
          "text": "And it all begins with understanding what truly matters to you.",
          "start_time": 126.67199999999997,
          "end_time": 130.22399999999996,
          "language": "en"
        },
        {
          "text": "\n",
          "start_time": 130.48799999999997,
          "end_time": 130.48799999999997,
          "language": "en"
        },
        {
          "text": "And all of this starts with knowing what truly matters to you.",
          "start_time": 126.67199999999997,
          "end_time": 130.22399999999996,
          "language": "source"
        },
        {
          "text": "\n",
          "start_time": 130.48799999999997,
          "end_time": 130.48799999999997,
          "language": "en"
        },
        {
          "text": "But the key to all of this is knowing exactly what you truly value.",
          "start_time": 126.67199999999997,
          "end_time": 130.22399999999996,
          "language": "source"
        },
        {
          "text": "\n",
          "start_time": 130.48799999999997,
          "end_time": 130.48799999999997,
          "language": "en"
        },
        {
